<title>UK: Baltic Freight Index fell eight points to 1,442.</title>
<headline>Baltic Freight Index fell eight points to 1,442.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Baltic Freight Index for spot dry cargo shipping rates fell to 1,442 today from 1,450 on April 8, with the base being Jan 4 1985 equals 1,000. The BFI is based on the following sub-indices with rates in dollars per tonne.</p>
<p> Route Index     Rate   Prev Index  Rate</p>
<p>   1    1462    13.269	  1467    13.319</p>
<p>   1a   1459 11050.000	  1461 11069.000</p>
